Package: pdfcube
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PDF presentation viewer with animated 3D transitions
 PDFCube renders PDF presentations with shader-based OpenGL cube transitions,
 programmed slide timing, and keyboard-controlled zoom regions.
